					<h1>Westminster Research Associates</h1>
					
					<H2>An Innovative Approach to Commission Management.</H2>
<P><A href="/ASSETS/3B0E9BA1B2C24D259E2189AF7F40B731/" target=_top>Westminster Research Associates</A>&nbsp;is one of the largest and most respected providers of commission management services to the institutional investment community. We offer an innovative framework for third-party research and execution management. </P>
<P>We provide choice and execution flexibility.&nbsp; Through our unique and extensive WRA Network, you can execute either through our own BNY ConvergEx Group broker-dealers or across a network of top-tier institutional trading partners, while consolidating your commission management activities with one firm. </P>
<P>We make it possible&nbsp;to help&nbsp;you maximize the value of your commission dollars, manage your research payments and seek best execution on your terms—all through a single partner. </P>
<P>&nbsp;</P>
<P>&nbsp;</P>
<P>&nbsp;</P>
<P>&nbsp;</P>
<P>&nbsp;</P>
<P>&nbsp;</P>
<P>&nbsp;</P>
<P>&nbsp;</P>
<P>&nbsp;</P>
<P>&nbsp;</P>
